{
  "_doc": "Maps exact Odoo project.project names to repo folders under the repos tree (resolved by scripts/repos-dir.sh; override with REPOS_DIR). Edit ONLY via scripts/repo-map.sh (atomic, validated); never hand-edit. Entries are added only with explicit user confirmation. branch_flow is the ordered environment chain, last element production; flow_confirmed: true means a human vouched for that chain. A flow without flow_confirmed was parsed from the old free-text notes and must be confirmed before it drives a promotion. repo_path is optional and holds an absolute path to the checkout, overriding $REPOS_DIR/$repo for a repo that is not under a flat repos tree (a bind mount such as /mnt/extra-addons); an entry carrying it never consults repos-dir.sh.",
  "projects": {}
}
